## Getting Started

### Prerequisites

- Node.js 18+ (install via [nvm](https://github.com/nvm-sh/nvm) or [nodejs.org](https://nodejs.org/))

### Installation

```bash
npm install
```

### Building

```bash
npm run build
```

### Running

```bash
npm start
# or for development
npm run dev
```

### Testing

```bash
npm test
# or watch mode
npm run test:watch
```

### Linting

```bash
npm run lint
{{#if use_prettier}}
npm run format:check
{{/if}}
```

